{"title":"🎃 Halloween Special: Meet New People | + 50+ Board Games | 21–45","startsAt":"2026-10-31T19:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-31T21:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"🎃 Looking for a fun way to meet new people in Toronto this Halloween?\n\nYou could walk into a room full of strangers and hope a conversation happens… or you could let us make the first step easy.\n\nJoin us for a Halloween Special at Stout Irish Pub, where Fast Friends takes the guesswork out of making new connections.\n\nThrough relaxed, professionally hosted conversations, rotations and Halloween-themed connection rounds, you'll meet 20+ people, discover common interests and have plenty of reasons to laugh and chat along the way.\n\n🎃 Costumes are welcome but completely optional — come dressed up, add a little Halloween flair, or simply come as you are.\n\nAnd the best part? The evening doesn't stop when the hosted rounds do.\nAfterwards, stick around at Stout for 50+ board games, drinks and more time to socialise with the people you've just met. 🎲🍻\n\nBook Early & Save: [https://toronto31stoct.eventbrite.co.uk](https://toronto31stoct.eventbrite.co.uk)\nEarly Bird: CAD $10 \\| Regular: CAD $15 \\| Door: CAD $20 cash\n\nAdvance tickets help us plan the right space and group size and ensure a well-organised experience for everyone.\n\n🤝 What to Expect\n7:00 PM — Welcome & Drinks\nMeet your host, Kruttika, grab a drink and settle in.\nComing alone? You're in good company. Many of our guests arrive solo, and our host will help you get comfortable, make introductions and get the evening started.\n\n7:30–8:30 PM — Hosted Fast Friends\nThis is where the evening really gets going.\nYou'll have a series of short, guided conversations, moving around the group so you get the chance to meet a variety of people rather than spending the whole evening talking to just one person.\nNo need to walk up to strangers and figure out what to say — we've created the structure for you.\n\n🎃 Halloween-Themed Connection Rounds\nAlongside the regular Fast Friends conversations, we'll add some Halloween-inspired themed rounds with fun prompts and challenges designed to get people laughing, talking and discovering what they have in common.\nExpect a few seasonal twists — nothing complicated, just an easy way to make the conversations even more fun.\n\n🎲 8:30 PM onwards — 50+ Board Games & Socialising\nDon't feel like heading home after the hosted rounds?\nStay and keep the evening going at Stout.\nWith 50+ board games available, you can join a game with people you've met, grab another drink, continue a conversation or simply mingle and see where the evening takes you.\nYou don't need to be a serious gamer — the games are simply another easy way to keep people interacting.\n\n🍻 And if you're staying later, Stout's After Dark Special runs from 9–11 PM, with $7 beers and $7 highballs, among other specials.\n\n❤️ Why This Event?\n✔️ Halloween Special 🎃\n✔️ Meet 25+ new people in one evening\n✔️ Professionally hosted conversations and rotations\n✔️ Halloween-themed connection rounds\n✔️ Costumes welcome — but completely optional\n✔️ 50+ board games at Stout 🎲\n✔️ Reserved area for our group\n✔️ Easy-to-reach Toronto location\n✔️ Relaxed Irish-pub atmosphere\n✔️ Most guests attend solo\n✔️ Meet members from across our Toronto social communities\n✔️ Ages 25–45\n✔️ Friendship-focused — not a dating event\n\n👥 Who Should Come?\nWhether you've recently moved to Toronto, have lived here for years, work from home and want a bigger social circle, or simply feel like meeting some different people — you're welcome.\nYou don't need to know anyone beforehand.\nCome by yourself, bring a friend, wear a costume or don't — the evening is designed to make it easy to get involved and start connecting.\n\n💳 Why Book in Advance?\nYour ticket helps us plan the right space, manage the group size and create a comfortable experience for everyone.\nOnline tickets are also cheaper than paying at the door.\n\n🌍 About Fast Friends\nFor over 10 years, Fast Friends has been helping people make genuine connections through professionally hosted social events in 30+ cities around the world.\nOur goal is simple: make meeting new people easier, more relaxed and more enjoyable.\nCome solo. We’ll guide the experience. You make the connections. ❤️","venue":{"name":"Stout Irish pub","address":"221 Carlton St., Toronto, ON M5A 2L2, Canada,, Toronto","lat":43.663795,"lng":-79.368904,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Singles in the city (13000+)","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/0/f/1/highres_536393489.jpeg"}